OL,3,GNEWSAFerguson shipyard to cut a quarter
OL,4,Aof its workforce
OL,5,
OL,6,FScotland's state-owned shipyard is to
OL,7,Fcut nearly a quarter of its total
OL,8,Fworkforce while it waits for
OL,9,Fconfirmation of promised new orders.
OL,11,FWorkers at Ferguson Marine have been
OL,12,Finvited to apply for voluntary
OL,13,Fredundancy as construction draws to a
OL,14,Fclose on the second of two long-delayed
OL,15,FCalMac ferries.
OL,17,FThe Port Glasgow firm currently employs
OL,18,F247 core staff, 31 agency staff and 32
OL,19,Fapprentices - but says it expects to
OL,20,Fshed 70 posts through a voluntary
OL,21,Fredundancy process.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
