OL,3,GNEWSAFerguson shipyard to cut a quarter
OL,4,Aof its workforce
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish government has promised to
OL,7,Fdirectly award the yard new orders for
OL,8,Ffour smaller ships, but ministers say
OL,9,Fthey are still conducting "due
OL,10,Fdiligence" on the plan.
